OL,3,GNEWSANHS staff may have inappropriately
OL,4,Aaccessed Southport victims' records
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo more NHS staff are under
OL,7,Finvestigation over allegations they
OL,8,Finappropriately accessed Southport
OL,9,Fstabbing victims' medical records.
OL,11,FLiverpool Heart and Chest NHS
OL,12,FFoundation Trust identified the cases
OL,13,Fwhile carrying out a "retrospective
OL,14,Faudit" of which staff had accessed
OL,15,Finformation about the victims of the
OL,16,FJuly 2024 attack on a children's dance
OL,17,Fclass.
OL,19,FIn May, the University Hospitals of
OL,20,FLiverpool Group (UHLG) admitted that
OL,21,Fnearly 50 of its staff had wrongly
OL,22,Flooked at victims' medical files.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
